# Dashboard Overview

The Events CRM dashboard provides a centralized view of all your events, guests, and RSVP activity. This guide helps you navigate the interface efficiently.

## Sidebar Navigation

The sidebar on the left provides access to all main sections:

- **Dashboard** - Overview of your workspace activity
- **Events** - List and manage all your events
- **Docs** - Access this documentation

Use the workspace selector at the top of the sidebar to switch between different workspaces if you have access to multiple.

## Events List

The **Events** page displays all your events as cards showing:

- Event name and date
- Venue/location
- RSVP progress bar with percentage
- Guest count breakdown (Confirmed, Pending, Declined)
- Status badge

### Event Status Badges

Events progress through different statuses:

- **Draft** - Event is being set up, not yet published
- **Planning** - Event details are being finalized
- **RSVP Open** - Guests can submit their RSVPs
- **Completed** - Event has concluded

## Event Detail Page

Click on any event card to open its detail page. The event detail page uses a tabbed interface:

### Available Tabs

- **Overview** - RSVP statistics and quick actions
- **Guests** - Full guest list with search and filters
- **Categories** - Manage guest categories (AAA, A, B, etc.)
- **Emails** - Email templates for this event
- **Branding** - Customize logos and colors
- **Settings** - Event configuration and details

### Overview Tab

The Overview tab provides at-a-glance metrics:

- **RSVP Response Rate** - Visual progress bar showing confirmed vs total invited
- **Status Breakdown** - Count of guests by RSVP status (Confirmed, Pending, Maybe, Declined)
- **Category Breakdown** - Response rates per guest category
- **Quick Actions** - Common tasks like sending reminders or exporting data

{% callout type="info" %}
The Overview tab updates in real-time as guests respond to their RSVP invitations.
{% /callout %}

## Quick Navigation Tips

- Click the **Events** breadcrumb to return to the events list from any event page
- Use the tab navigation to quickly switch between event sections
- The sidebar remains visible on desktop for fast access to other areas
